								<w:t>Due to the technical limitations of NGS, not all genomic alterations in the targeted regions can be detected. Therefore, the test results should be interpreted in the context of the patient’s clinical and pathological characteristics as well as other laboratory findings. In addition, information/suggestions provided in this report on the relevant treatment options, clinical trials and other scientific findings are based on the clinical guidelines, clinical trial registry and scientific literature which are continuously evolving. It is the user’s responsibility to verify these information/suggestions against the most recent advancement in the aforementioned sources. The diagnostic and/or treatment implications of these information/suggestions should be interpreted only by licensed/certified medical professionals.</w:t>
