									<w:sz w:val="14" />
									<w:szCs w:val="14" /></w:rPr>
							</w:pPr>
							<w:r>
								<w:rPr>
									<w:rFonts w:ascii="Times New Roman" w:hAnsi="Times New Roman" />
									<w:sz w:val="14" />
									<w:szCs w:val="14" /></w:rPr>
								<w:t>* The toxicity and efficacy of chemotherapy drugs are often affected by multiple genetic polymorphisms. Due to the limitations of the current knowledge in pharmacogenomics, the conclusions based on genotypes alone may sometimes contradict to each other. In addition, other genetic or environmental factors could also influence the toxicity and efficacy of chemotherapy drugs.</w:t>
							</w:r>
						</w:p>
